* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_pf (reference/crafted.toml, 9 Nov 2026): a line reactance on
* demo12's electricity link between REG1 and REG2, which sets %POWERFLO% YES (init_ext.vda
* L134) and makes the link a two-node DC power-flow grid (powerflo.vda, phase-angle
* formulation; M1.3 changes 27a-27b).
PARAMETER PRC_REACT /
REG1.2005.TB_ELC_REG1_REG2_01 0.05
REG2.2005.TB_ELC_REG1_REG2_01 0.05
/;
